      "reasoning": "Each current answer agrees with the earlier selection and its own captured worked solution. q-11637: CD=DC=I₂, whereas DE has entry (2,1)=-2, so I and III alone hold. q-102674: AB=BA=I₂, whereas AC has entry (1,2)=-5, so I and III alone hold. q-71879: BC=CB=I₃, whereas AB has entry (1,2)=-1; hence II alone holds and A is not B⁻¹. q-149832: AC=CA=I₃, whereas AB has entry (1,1)=2; hence II alone holds and B is not A⁻¹. q-128491: det(S)=2\\sqrt{7}(2\\sqrt{7})+(1/2)(-10)=23, which is nonzero and differs from 5+2\\sqrt{7}; only II holds. q-128480: det(D)=2(-11)+3(7)+1=0, so D is singular and only I and III hold. No grade is supplied; confirmation rests on the captured worked solutions and independent mathematics. The previously identified working error concerned q-128309, which is absent from the current batch.",
